{"id":464,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"This Pokémon evolved through use of a curious item. Its rocklike hide is composed of a mysterious substance and can withstand a blow from a masterwork sword with nary a scratch."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It relies on its carapace to deflect incoming attacks and throw its enemy off balance. As soon as that happens, it drives its drill into the foe."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It can load up to three projectiles per arm into the holes in its hands. What launches out of those holes could be either rocks or Roggenrola."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. Geodude are shot at rare times."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"From holes in its palms, it fires out Geodude. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Lightning Rod","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon draws in all Electric-type moves. Instead of taking damage from them, its Sp. Atk stat is boosted."},{"name":"Solid Rock","hidden":false,"description":"Reduces the power of supereffective attacks that hit the Pokémon."},{"name":"Reckless","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up moves that have recoil damage."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":111,"name":"Rhyhorn","condition":null,"children":[{"id":112,"name":"Rhydon","condition":"Lv. 42","children":[{"id":464,"name":"Rhyperior","condition":"Trade, holding Protector","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,39],[1,359],[1,479],[1,523],[15,30],[20,184],[25,23],[30,350],[35,529],[40,36],[47,89],[54,444],[61,224],[68,32],